% The %%MIDI commands of a voice write their events on the track of this
% voice, and not on the conductor track of a tune with several tracks
% (GitHub issue #71).  This track had a copy of the events of %%MIDI
% control, portamento, noportamento, pitchbendrange and snt, at the time
% of its last tempo change or at time 0: the two volumes below were both
% set at time 0, so that the first bar was played with the volume of the
% third.
X:1
T:MIDI controls in a tune with two voices
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/4
Q:1/4=120
K:C
V:1
C D E F |
%%MIDI control 7 40
G A B c |
%%MIDI control 7 50
c B A G |]
V:2
C,4 | G,4 | C,4 |]
